BUA-LEL includes a local adaptation of the Segment Anything package.
The builder accepts explicit local checkpoints, and predictor imports are
relative to this package. BUA-LEL retains the ViT image encoder for its own
lesion-prior and morphology pathways. No model weights are distributed.
